en:
Thank you. Thanks to you, we
were able to meet each
other again.{end}

We are truly grateful to you.{FA:06}But we have just one more favor
to ask...{wait}...Just once more, we want... to
touch... each other...{end}

jp:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B92}（{call:@2AE7}はいま、どうおもっているの…？{FA:06}　あたしのことを、どうおもって
　いるの……？{FA:06}　{call:@2AE7}が、あたしをみつめている…。）
　{end}

{call:@2AB4}、おきていたのね……。{FA:06}あさごはんたべたら、
どこかいこうか？{FA:06}にんげんかいは、あそべるところ
いっぱいあるよ。{end}

en:
{call:@2AB4}, you're awake...{FA:06}After breakfast, want
to go somewhere?{FA:06}The human world has tons of fun places
to play.{end}

{call:@2A70}-sama, you live in the fun human
world, so you've already forgotten all
about the {call:@2B32}
kingdom, haven't you!{FA:06}You're happy now, {call:@2A70}-sama, so you
don't even feel like really looking for
everyone from the kingdom anymore...{end}

Well done, {call:@2AB4}-chan.{FA:06}But do give up on finding your mother,
my dear.{FA:06}Searching for her would be such a
bother. {call:@2B13} wants no part of it.{end}

{FA:FF0201}Oh? I dressed up as a {call:@2B32}, and a
princess really did show up!{FA:06}I'm just so lucky, aren't I~!
{FA:FF0200}{end}

jp:
えっ！　ピンクちゃん
もいるの！？
どこ？　どこ？{end}

へ？　なんで？
あんたたち、
なにいってんの？{end}

ちょ、ちょっと！
あたしをほうって、
どこへいくのよ！{end}

{FA:FF0201}ふざけるな！
にがさん！
{FA:FF0200}{end}

な～にが「きれいなうみ」よ！
おおなみ・おおあらし・あらくれる
うみじゃないの！　ゲほッ、ぷはっ！{end}

en:
What do you mean, "a beautiful sea"?!
It's huge waves, huge storms, a raging
sea! *cough* *gasp*!{end}

jp:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B92}（でも、うれしかった……。
　たとえそれがウソでも…………、
　とってもうれしかった！）{end}

…ほら、くだらねえこと
いってないで、いくぞ。{FA:06}みんなしんぱいしている
だろうからな。{end}

{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A96}{call:@2B99}…いずれにしても、だいじな
てがみをひろってしまったせきにんが
あるよ、わたしたちには。{end}

en:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A96}{call:@2B99}...Either way, we picked
up an important letter, so it's
our responsibility now.{end}

jp:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B99}そうよね………。
「うみからのラブレターひろいました」
これでいいかな？{end}

en:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B99}You're right... "Found: a
love letter from the sea."
How's that?{end}

jp:
「うみからのこいぶみひろいました。
　こころあたりのあるかたは
　プチホテル・パールピアリまで」{end}

en:
"Found: a love note from the
sea. If it's yours, please come
to the Petit Hotel Pearl Piari."{end}

jp:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B99}……でも、あたしね。
しりたいってはんめん、このままわからない
ほうがいいのかなっておもっているの。{end}

en:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B99}...But part of me wants
to know, and part of me thinks
it's better not to.{end}

jp:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A96}{call:@2B99}…よくかんがえたら、とくめいの
てがみなんだよな。もしかしたら、そっと
しておくべきなのかも……。{end}

en:
{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A96}{call:@2B99}...Come to think of it, it's
an anonymous letter. Maybe
we should just leave it be...{end}

{call:@2B8C}{call:@2A5B}{call:@2B92}Oh, Taki-san, why don't you
come see the meteor shower
with us?{end}

{call:@2B8C}{call:@2AE0}{call:@2B92}Oh no, I don't do well in
crowds. You young folks go
on ahead.{end}
